name=Custom Dialogue Creator
id=CustomDialogueCreator
description=Adds a "Custom Dialogue" editor to each clan in the Bandits Creator. Lets you write custom lines tied to a trigger (spotted, taking damage, reloading, breaching, etc.) with a chance to play instead of the mod's default generic dialogue. Custom lines are clan-specific and local-storage only.
require=Bandits2,BanditsCreator
